<title>USA: American Home unit buys assets of firm.</title>
<headline>American Home unit buys assets of firm.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sherwood-Davis &amp; Heck, a subsidiary of American Home Products Corp, said Thursday it acquired substantially all the assets of Accurate Surgical Instruments Corp.</p>
<p>Terms were not given.</p>
<p>Located in Toronto, Canada, Accurate Surgical develops, makes and markets a specialty line of peritoneal dialysis catheters.</p>
<p>Sherwood-Davis makes and markets medical and surgical devices.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
